  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing already blows water vapour from the nose into a round moisture shield that disperses wolf charges, before the Gu is even named.",
        "chapters": [
          134
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu is named Water Shield Gu during the fight against Fang Yuan and Xiong Li’s group.",
        "chapters": [
          136
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_xiong_li"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Near the end of Bai Ning Bing’s fight with Qing Shu, Fang Yuan uses Plunder Gu and catches Water Shield Gu from Bai Ning Bing’s body. He judges that Water Shield Gu with White Jade Gu would give him greater defensive power.",
        "chapters": [
          143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_plunder_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later rates the stolen Water Shield Gu and red steel Relic Gu as the useful takes from that body, beside a Stone Aperture Gu he has no use for.",
        "chapters": [
          144
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_red_steel_relic_gu",
          "gu_stone_aperture_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the aperture the Water Shield Gu floats like a jellyfish beside that Relic Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          145
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_relic_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He lists Water Shield Gu among the Gu worms he carries while weighing Gu Yue Yao Ji’s pressure on Nine Leaf Vitality Grass, and notes that the clan has turned a blind eye to Water Shield Gu, Plunder Gu, and his fast cultivation.",
        "chapters": [
          148
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_ji",
          "gu_nine_leaf_vitality_grass"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later activates it on the village wall against a bold lightning wolf’s electric current, then drops the shield to answer with moonblades.",
        "chapters": [
          149
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When a rank three Thunderclap Gu thunderball hits his tower, Water Shield Gu and White Jade Gu together keep him alive while nearby Gu Masters die. The thunder destroys the water shield within two breaths, and the Gu looks dull afterward. If the water shield is destroyed many times in a row, the Gu itself can be damaged and can perish.",
        "chapters": [
          150
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
